n, since two sources sharing the same lineage assumption is not the same as independent verification.' || v1.3 UPDATE (gap-closure pass): svara-to-chakra sourcing detail moved to the new canonical file structured/svara_chakra_mapping.json -- that file is now the source of truth for evidence_level/sources/review_status on this mapping; this field (swara_note_for_raaga_mapping) is a denormalized convenience copy and should be updated if the canonical file changes. REVISED STATUS: downgraded from 'corroborated by a second independent source' to 'two sources found, but judged to share the same lineage assumption -- NOT genuinely independent corroboration.' can_influence_chakra_score and can_influence_raga_recommendation are both explicitly false for this field.",
